{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_23","type":"agent_message","text":"Created and validated the TopoPilot2 pipeline:\n\n- [Script](sandbox:/workspace/ionization_topopilot.py) loads the `Ionization` time series, renders the original `Scalars_` field in viridis, applies persistence simplification `0.1`, and overlays its piecewise-linear contour tree.\n- Tree vertices: minima blue, 1-saddles white, 2-saddles orange, maxima red; radius 2.\n- Tree edges: thickness 1.\n- Verified render outputs: [time step 1](sandbox:/workspace/ionization_preview.png) and [time step 21](sandbox:/workspace/ionization_step21.png).\n\nThe script accepts the full time-series directory and can be run with `pvbatch` for any timestep or all steps."}}
